       },
       {
        "texto": "いません",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two final particles",
     "texto": [
      "**ね** at the end asks the other person to agree, like «right?»: **いい へや です ね** (what a nice room, isn't it?).",
      "**よ** gives information the other person doesn't know."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
